# Mutmut

## Do

- Run mutation testing only via `./scripts/run_mutmut.sh` (creates per-child DBs, sets workers, clears stale `mutants/` unless `MUTMUT_KEEP_CACHE=1`).
- Scope stays `only_mutate=app/users/service.py` with `source_paths=app/` (see `setup.cfg`).

## Don't

- Run bare `uv run mutmut run` — stale cache / 0 files mutated / schema races.

## Verify

```bash
./scripts/run_mutmut.sh
```
